        "_uid": "32df4a89-cf86-d3c2-eb5e-3db41c4b9ca6",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Labeling epilepsy as a major health problem in Pakistan. Dr Baig said it is a very common neurological disorder and can occur at any age and is present in several different forms. The causes for epilepsy vary with age and for more than 66 percent of the cases, there is no known cause for occurrence of this disease. Highlighting the importance of earlv diagnosis for epilepsy, Dr Baig revealed that \"if the disorder is recognized at an early stage, then in up to 70 percent of the cases, complete recover is possible with appropriate medication\" He stressed that the treatment has to be continued in appropriate dosage under strict supervision of a neurologist. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Commenting on facts and fiction about the epilepsy, Dr Baig informed that there are absolutely no medical restrictions for epileptic patients to get married and live a normal life.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
