    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"About one in twenty people will have epileptic fit at some point in their lives\", informed Dr Shahid Masud Baig, Consultant Neurologist at the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) He was giving a presentation on \"Epilepsy\" at \"Signs. Symptoms and Care\", monthly public health awareness program, held on December 26, 1998. Dr Baig added that epilepsy could strike at any age, however more than 70 percent of the cases occurs in first twenty years of life. A panel of Consultant Neurologists including Dr Farah Minhas, Dr Tehseen Muzaffar and Dr Nadir Ali Syed conducted a question and answer session",
